@*
========================================
PUBLIC INFORMATION MODULE - ABOUT US AND RULES
========================================
*@

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About us";
}

<section class="about-hero mb-4">
    <span class="about-eyebrow">RESERVE · PLAY · ENJOY</span>
    <h1>About SportHub</h1>
    <p>
        SportHub is a sports facility reservation and management platform for
        members, facility staff and administrators. It brings facility discovery,
        live availability, booking, account security and operational management
        into one clear process.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="row g-4 about-grid">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>How reservations work</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>Browse active facilities and review their price, location and details.</li>
                <li>Sign in as a Member before choosing a date and available time slot.</li>
                <li>The system checks past times, maintenance closures and booking conflicts.</li>
                <li>A successful request is recorded as Pending until an administrator reviews it.</li>
                <li>Use My reservations to follow its status, view the QR pass or add it to a calendar.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>Current-week booking policy</h2>
            <p>
                Members may reserve from the current Malaysian date through Sunday
                of the same week. A past date, a past time, or a date in a later week
                cannot be submitted. This short booking window keeps schedules current
                and gives all members a fair chance to use popular facilities.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
                A facility and time slot can only be held by one active reservation.
                Cancelled and rejected requests release that slot for another member.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>Arrival and facility care</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Arrive at least 10 minutes before the reserved session.</li>
                <li>Bring the reservation number or QR pass for verification.</li>
                <li>Wear suitable sports attire and follow staff safety instructions.</li>
                <li>Use only the assigned facility and leave it clean for the next group.</li>
                <li>Report damaged equipment, hazards or injuries immediately.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>Cancellation and payment</h2>
            <p>
                Future Pending or Approved reservations may be cancelled online while
                no successful payment is attached. Paid reservations require assistance
                from an administrator so payment and refund records remain accurate.
                Completed, rejected and already-cancelled reservations cannot be changed.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
                Facility prices are calculated from the current database record. Members
                should verify the amount and reservation status before arriving.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>Account and security rules</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Keep your password private and use accurate registration details.</li>
                <li>Five consecutive failed sign-in attempts cause a temporary 15-minute lock.</li>
                <li>Password-reset links are time-limited and should never be forwarded.</li>
                <li>Members can manage only their own profile and reservation records.</li>
                <li>Administrative pages are protected by role-based authorization.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <section class="about-card h-100">
            <h2>Fair play, privacy and support</h2>
            <p>
                Treat other members and staff respectfully. Fraudulent reservations,
                abusive behaviour, unsafe play or repeated no-shows may lead to account
                suspension. SportHub stores account, reservation and security-audit data
                only to operate and protect the service. Sensitive access is restricted
                according to user role.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
                If a closure, payment or account issue cannot be resolved online, contact
                the sports centre administration and include your reservation number.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="about-notice mt-4">
    <h2 class="h5">Important notice</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">
        Administrators may close facilities for maintenance, events, safety or emergency
        reasons. Availability shown by SportHub is checked again when a reservation is
        submitted, so a slot is never guaranteed until the request is successfully saved.
    </p>
</section>
